Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.02,0:22:17.52,sign_32727_342_Juju_Stroll,Screen&Three,0000,0000,0000,,Juju Stroll
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.71,0:22:27.02,Italics,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.60,0:22:32.79,Italics,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,If I recall, the edamame I had left over \Nfrom lunch was in the fridge...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.40,0:22:46.43,Main,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.43,0:22:49.92,Main,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,Please look at least a little guilty!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.93,0:22:56.68,Main,Cup,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnArial\b1\fs14\c&H62CEDC&\3c&HA2774A&\shad0\pos(320.667,270.667)}Seafood
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.48,0:22:52.81,Main,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,Here, have this and forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.81,0:22:56.68,Main,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,No, I'm not interested \Nin late-night cup ramen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.31,0:23:00.69,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(275,1)\pos(164,190)\fs16\c&H383733&\3c&HAEA5A6&\bord1\shad0\frz20.54}Hot\NChili\NPepper
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.31,0:23:00.69,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(275,1)\c&H9A85E7&\3c&HF9F6FE&\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\fs18\b1\pos(548.667,185.333)\frz314.5}Milk
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.46,0:23:00.69,Main,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,How about this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.69,0:23:03.69,Main,Momo&Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(139,60)\fs20\b1\an8\c&HBBEC62&\3c&HFEFEFE&\shad0}Nishimiya-style
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.69,0:23:03.69,Main,Momo&Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnArial\b1\pos(310,148)\frz4.48\fs30\c&H8066EC&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HD6A3D7&\shad2}Seafood Cup Ramen
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.69,0:23:03.69,Main,Momo&Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnArial\b1\frz4.48\fs30\c&HECE464&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&H7F85B0&\shad2\pos(396,289.333)}Ar{\c&HE29CD4&}ra{\c&HBA6FE6&}n{\c&H53A2EB&}ge{\c&H9EDE7B&}me{\c&H80FDFC&}nt!!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.88,0:23:03.69,Main,Momo&Screen,0000,0000,0000,,Nishimiya-style Seafood Cup Ramen arrangement!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.37,0:23:07.15,Main,Momo&Screen,0000,0000,0000,,One: use scissors to chop up hot chili peppers
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.15,0:23:08.84,Main,Momo&Screen,0000,0000,0000,,into the seafood cup ramen!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.73,0:23:13.23,Main,Momo&Screen,0000,0000,0000,,Two: fill the container halfway with milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.23,0:23:16.41,Main,Momo&Screen,0000,0000,0000,,Three: add hot water up to the line inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.41,0:23:19.64,Main,Momo&Screen,0000,0000,0000,,Since we're using milk, \Nmake sure the water's boiling hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.25,0:23:25.96,Italics,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,I-It's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.68,0:23:28.65,Main,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,This is really good!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.65,0:23:29.82,Main,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.82,0:23:31.96,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe I'll try it next time, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.96,0:23:35.93,Main,Miwa,0000,0000,0000,,You could've just eaten \Nthis if it's so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.66,0:23:42.30,Main,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you still pay for late-night \Ncup ramen the next day.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.30,0:23:44.39,Main,Mai,0000,0000,0000,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.53,0:23:54.99,Next_Ep_Title,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1026,1)}Episode 18:\NSage
